<item><title>Libyan command vows response after two naval staff die in Benghazi attack</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-command-vows-response-after-two-naval-staff-die-in-662433/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-command-vows-response-after-two-naval-staff-die-in-662433/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The General Command said the officers died from injuries sustained in an attack on Benghazi Port and explosions involving the targeted vessel.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:27:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
